<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia private sector credit rises in Jan.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia private sector credit rises in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA) said on Friday private sector credit extended by financial intermediaries rose by 0.8 percent in January seasonally-adjusted, after rising 0.8 percent in December.</p>
<p>For the year to January, credit rose by 9.6 percent, compared with a year-over-year rise of 10.0 percent in December.</p>
</text>
